\p \v 9 \w So Hathach|strong="H02047"\w* \w went back|strong="H00935"\w* \w and relayed|strong="H05046"\w* \w Mordecai’s|strong="H04782"\w* \w response|strong="H01697"\w* \w to Esther|strong="H00635"\w*.
\p \v 10 \w Then Esther|strong="H00635"\w* \w spoke|strong="H00559"\w* \w to Hathach|strong="H02047"\w* \w and instructed him|strong="H06680"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w tell Mordecai|strong="H04782"\w*, \v 11 “\w All|strong="H03605"\w* \w the royal|strong="H04428"\w* \w officials|strong="H05650"\w* \w and the people|strong="H05971"\w* \w of the king’s|strong="H04428"\w* \w provinces|strong="H04082"\w* \w know|strong="H03045"\w* \w that|strong="H00834"\w* \w one|strong="H00259"\w* \w law|strong="H01881"\w* \w applies to every|strong="H03605"\w* \w man|strong="H00376"\w* \w or woman|strong="H00802"\w* \w who|strong="H00834"\w* \w approaches|strong="H00935"\w* \w the king|strong="H04428"\w* \w in|strong="H00413"\w* \w the inner|strong="H06442"\w* \w court|strong="H02691"\w* \w without|strong="H00834"\w* \w being summoned|strong="H07121"\w*— \w that he be put to death|strong="H04191"\w*. \w Only if|strong="H00905"\w* \w the king|strong="H04428"\w* \w extends|strong="H03447"\w* \w the gold|strong="H02091"\w* \w scepter|strong="H08275"\w* \w may that person live|strong="H02421"\w*. \w But I|strong="H00589"\w* \w have not|strong="H03808"\w* \w been summoned|strong="H07121"\w* \w to appear|strong="H00935"\w* \w before|strong="H00413"\w* \w the|strong="H02088"\w* \w king|strong="H04428"\w* \w for the past thirty|strong="H07970"\w* \w days|strong="H03117"\w*.”
\p \v 12 \w When Esther’s|strong="H00635"\w* \w words|strong="H01697"\w* \w were relayed|strong="H05046"\w* \w to Mordecai|strong="H04782"\w*, \v 13 \w he|strong="H04782"\w* \w sent back|strong="H00559"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w her|strong="H00635"\w* \w this reply|strong="H07725"\w*: “\w Do not|strong="H00408"\w* \w imagine that|strong="H01819"\w* \w because you are|strong="H05315"\w* \w in the king’s|strong="H04428"\w* \w palace|strong="H01004"\w* \w you alone will escape|strong="H04422"\w* \w the fate of all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the Jews|strong="H03064"\w*. \v 14 \w For|strong="H03588"\w* \w if|strong="H00518"\w* \w you remain silent|strong="H02790"\w* \w at this|strong="H02063"\w* \w time|strong="H06256"\w*, \w relief|strong="H07305"\w* \w and deliverance|strong="H02020"\w* \w for the Jews|strong="H03064"\w* \w will arise|strong="H05975"\w* \w from another|strong="H00312"\w* \w place|strong="H04725"\w*, \w but you|strong="H00859"\w* \w and your father’s|strong="H00001"\w* \w house|strong="H01004"\w* \w will perish|strong="H00006"\w*. \w And who|strong="H04310"\w* \w knows|strong="H03045"\w* \w if perhaps|strong="H00518"\w* \w you have come|strong="H05060"\w* \w to the kingdom|strong="H04438"\w* \w for such a time|strong="H06256"\w* \w as this|strong="H02063"\w*?”
